T:All Creatures of Our God and King
T:LASST UNS ERFREUEN
C:Music: from Geistliche Kirchengesäng, Köln, 1623 · Words: Francis of Assisi circa 1225. Translated by William H. Draper, 1919
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: 'Lutheran Worship' Hymnal, 1982 Hymn 436.. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/lasst_uns_erfreuen): 100% of pitches and 100% of note lengths agree.
